# The root .gitignore excludes `*.app` (macOS bundles). Git matches it
# case-insensitively on Windows checkouts (core.ignorecase), so it also matches
# the DIRECTORY `PicoSwitch.Companion.Linux.App` and would silently drop the
# whole Avalonia app from version control. Git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is excluded, so the directory itself is un-excluded, BEFORE
# the build-output rules below (the last matching pattern wins).
!src/PicoSwitch.Companion.Linux.App/

# .NET build output.
bin/
obj/

# AppImage build staging and output (packaging/build-appimage.sh).
/artifacts/
